@startuml sequence_login
' Cấu hình giao diện cho gọn gàng và hiện đại
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

' 1. Khai báo các đối tượng tham gia (Lifelines)
actor "Client (Flutter/Web)" as Client
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthService" as Service
participant "UserRepository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

' 2. Bắt đầu luồng gọi
Client -> Controller: POST /api/auth/login\n(email, password)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: LoginAsync(email, password)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: GetUserByEmailAsync(email)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ...
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Return UserData / null
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: Return ApplicationUser
deactivate Repo

' 3. Khối điều kiện Rẽ nhánh (If/Else)
alt User is Null OR Password Invalid
    Service --> Controller: Throw UnauthorizedException
    Controller --> Client: 401 Unauthorized (Error Message)
else Valid Credentials (Đăng nhập thành công)
    ' Self-message (Hàm nội bộ)
    Service -> Service: GenerateJwtToken()
    Service -> Service: GenerateRefreshToken()
    
    ' Lưu Refresh Token mới xuống DB
    Service -> Repo: UpdateRefreshTokenAsync(...)
    activate Repo
    Repo -> DB: UPDATE users SET refresh_token = ...
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: Success
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Service: Success
    deactivate Repo

    Service --> Controller: Return TokenPair (Access, Refresh)
end
deactivate Service

Controller --> Client: 200 OK (JSON TokenPair)
deactivate Controller

@enduml